# Cloudflare Pages static redirects.
# Vite copies files from client/public/ into dist/, so this file ends up in
# client/dist/_redirects in every Pages build (build-postprocessing).
#  1) Forward all /api/* requests to the Worker.
#  2) SPA fallback for React Router deep links.
/api/*  https://tradepro-crm-api.YOUR_ACCOUNT_SUBDOMAIN.workers.dev/api/:splat  200
/*      /index.html  200